abstract: "An interactive visualization and analysis tool for examining geographic mention patterns and keywords in the Lagos Weekly Record (1891-1921), a historical Nigerian newspaper published in colonial Lagos. Supports bilingual interface (English/Japanese). This work was supported by JSPS KAKENHI Grant Number JP19K13372."
